    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">No. of solutions providers from different ministries and societal groups eg.youth, women, technopreneurs, B40 participates in the national conference. 
No. of solutions are published in the MalaysiaInnovates publication and socialized across different ministries and public audiences.
Implementation and completion of Innovate Malaysia conference and publication.</narrative>
    </description>
    <baseline year="2022">
     <comment>
      <narrative xml:lang="EN">Innovation Summit at such a scale has never been done before.</narrative>
     </comment>
    </baseline>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2022-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2022-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">At least 25 solutions providers from different ministries and societal groups eg.youth, women, technopreneurs, B40 participates in the national conference. 
At least 25 solutions are published in the MalaysiaInnovates publication and socialized across different ministries and public audiences.
Innovate Malaysia conference and publication successfully completed and communicated through project coordinator and knowledge management consultant.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </target>
     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">29 solutions providers from different ministries and societal groups eg.youth, women, technopreneurs, B40 participates in the national conference. 
29 solutions are published in the Malaysia Innovates publication and socialized across different ministries and public audiences.
Innovate Malaysia conference was held on 2-3 August successfully and publication were completed and communicated through project coordinator and knowledge management consultant on 31 August 2022.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
   </indicator>
  </result>
